{"ticker":"CAH","updated":"2026-10-23T22:43:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Cardinal Health, Inc.","shortName":"Cardinal Health, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Distribution","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cardinalhealth.com","fullTimeEmployees":58788,"marketCap":57790267392,"trailingPE":34.518673,"forwardPE":17.75148,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.22729881,"pegRatio":1.28,"targetMeanPrice":273.46667,"targetHighPrice":295.0,"targetLowPrice":235.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.058,"earningsGrowth":0.688,"grossMargins":0.03844,"operatingMargins":0.013300001,"profitMargins":0.00674,"totalRevenue":254247993344,"beta":0.501,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":259.21,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":158.7,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.81},"summary":"Cardinal Health, Inc. operates as a healthcare services and products company in the United States and internationally. It operates in two segments: Pharmaceutical and Specialty Solutions, and Global Medical Products and Distribution. The company offers customized solutions for hospitals, healthcare systems, pharmacies, ambulatory surgery centers, clinical laboratories, physician offices, and patients in the home. It distributes branded and generic pharmaceutical, specialty pharmaceutical, and over-the-counter healthcare and consumer products. The company also provides services to pharmaceutical manufacturers and healthcare providers for specialty pharmaceutical products; pharmacy management services to hospitals; operates pharmacies, including pharmacies in community health centers; and repackages generic pharmaceuticals and over-the-counter healthcare products. In addition, it manufactures, sources, and distributes Cardinal Health branded medical, surgical, and laboratory products and devices that include exam and surgical gloves; needles, syringe, and sharps disposals; compression, incontinence, nutritional delivery, and wound care products; single-use surgical drapes, gowns, and apparel products; fluid suction and collection systems; urology products; operating room supply products; and electrode product lines. Further, the company distributes a range of national brand produ","summary_zh":"康德樂 (Cardinal Health), Inc. 在美國和國際上經營一家醫療保健服務和產品公司。它分為兩個部門：製藥和專業解決方案部門以及全球醫療產品和分銷部門。該公司為醫院、醫療保健系統、藥房、門診手術中心、臨床實驗室、醫生辦公室和家庭患者提供客製化解決方案。它經銷品牌藥品和仿製藥、特種藥品以及非處方醫療保健和消費品。該公司還為藥品製造商和醫療保健提供者提供特殊藥品服務；為醫院提供藥房管理服務；經營藥房，包括社區健康服務中心藥房；並重新包裝仿製藥和非處方保健品。此外，該公司還生產、採購和分銷 Cardinal Health 品牌的醫療、外科和實驗室產品和設備，包括檢查和手術手套；針頭、注射器和銳器處置；壓迫、失禁、營養輸送和傷口護理產品；一次性手術單、手術服和服裝產品；流體吸入和收集系統；泌尿科產品；手術室供應產品；和電極產品線。此外，公司也經銷一系列國家品牌產品","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療配送","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":148.09,"h":148.8,"l":145.96,"c":146.04,"v":1674900},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":146.38,"h":147.78,"l":146.04,"c":147.49,"v":2982200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":147.91,"h":149.44,"l":147.01,"c":149.24,"v":2302100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":148.92,"h":151.0,"l":148.28,"c":149.51,"v":3290800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":149.72,"h":150.51,"l":148.16,"c":148.78,"v":2723200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":147.87,"h":150.45,"l":147.27,"c":149.55,"v":1767300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":149.55,"h":150.58,"l":148.87,"c":150.56,"v":1652600},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":150.62,"h":151.38,"l":146.22,"c":149.34,"v":2366700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":149.02,"h":149.6,"l":148.12,"c":149.56,"v":1715400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":149.68,"h":150.49,"l":148.39,"c":150.28,"v":2771500},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":150.01,"h":151.45,"l":148.77,"c":150.94,"v":1306400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":150.57,"h":152.51,"l":149.25,"c":149.29,"v":1962400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":150.09,"h":152.77,"l":149.35,"c":152.47,"v":1790600},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":152.37,"h":153.89,"l":151.82,"c":152.24,"v":1162600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":152.22,"h":152.39,"l":150.23,"c":150.27,"v":1207400},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":151.02,"h":151.02,"l":148.26,"c":148.37,"v":2852700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":149.35,"h":149.75,"l":147.48,"c":148.68,"v":2011600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":148.53